      "patch": {
        "title_en": "Moriarty the Patriot: The Musical -A Scandal in the British Empire Reprise-",
        "summary_en": "A reworked staging of the “A Scandal in the British Empire” arc from 2020’s Op.2, with a renewed cast. William and Sherlock become entangled in Irene Adler’s theft of royal secrets.",
        "summary": "2020年のOp.2「大英帝国の醜聞」編を新たなキャストと再構成。王室の機密文書を盗んだアイリーン・アドラーをめぐり、ウィリアムとシャーロックの計略が交錯する。"
      },
